# A lint configuration bans at least the listed methods
law lint_bans_include
kind audit
claim a lint configuration bans every method of the list, and may ban more
claim the comparison is of names as text, in any order, duplicates ignored
source ALICE-Law G1 (the methods a crate that states a deterministic result must not call)

input compared 1
x-input banned list of text      # the method names the configuration bans

begin audit
audit lint-bans-include
evidence compared
includes banned f32::sin f32::cos f64::sin_cos
end audit

verdict the verdict of the audit block for the given measurements
